      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "お、おはようございます。\nえっと、何をおっしゃっているんですか……？",
      "jp_sha256": "fa56451932441ab5e43300db0d482b32bc93a67bc922aaee0a34c556e8ef05dd",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아, 안녕하세요.\n저기, 무슨 말씀을 하시는 거예요……?",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 17,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
