      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ええ、私もそう思ったわ。\nそうしたら「全部だワン」と言われたから、\nそういうものなのだと思ったんだけど。",
      "jp_sha256": "6a8ba97c07437e5cf22aee25b1de146355819ba483fdfb16515dd7cec9a3bdb6",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "응, 나도 그렇게 생각했어.\n그랬더니 ‘전부다멍’이라고 하길래,\n원래 그런 건가 싶었거든.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 24,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
